          {
            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 21210,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for starting this. Reading A1 now. The scope seems broad. To make this marketable for launch, we should focus on 2-3 core use cases. I suggest 'cash flow optimization' and 'growth readiness assessment'. What do you all think?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "thinking_face",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M3",
            "speaker_id": 509812,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "I agree with @21210. A tight focus helps with a clear story for PR. 'Growth readiness' is a strong angle. We could add 'digital transformation advisory' as a third, but maybe that's for a later phase to avoid scope creep.",
            "mentions": [
              21210
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
