          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M4",
            "speaker_id": 89373,
            "reply_to": "M2",
            "text": "From a BI perspective, 'cash flow optimization' and 'growth readiness' are feasible with our current data sources. 'Digital transformation' would require new data points we don't have yet. So I'd support keeping it simple for the first launch.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M5",
            "speaker_id": 59192,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "What kind of SMEs are we targeting? Is it based on revenue or number of employees? This will affect the financial analysis.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M6",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M5",
            "text": "Good question. I was thinking any small business. I can add a section on that to A1.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
