          {
            "msg_id": "M7",
            "speaker_id": 21210,
            "reply_to": "M6",
            "text": "Let's define that more clearly to ensure our marketing hits the right audience. How about we target SMEs with 10-50 employees and $1M-$10M in annual revenue? That segment typically has the complexity to need this service but lacks in-house resources.",
            "mentions": [
              8267
