            "msg_id": "M24",
            "speaker_id": 509812,
            "reply_to": "M22",
            "text": "Maybe we can frame it as 'Minimum data for maximum insight'. Also, we need to be crystal clear on data privacy. @59192 have you started on the data protection guidelines for T8? We should link A4 from A2.",
