        "thread_id": "TH3",
        "thread_goal": "Finalize pricing, packaging, and commercial positioning for launch.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hi all, I've put together the pricing model in A3. There are three tiers. Please review and share your feedback. This is for my task T4.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3",
              "T4"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 59192,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "Thanks. Looking at the cost assumptions in A3. The consultant time seems a bit low for the 'Premium' tier, especially with the quarterly reviews. It might hurt our margins.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "I thought we could make it efficient. Do you think I should increase the hours?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 21210,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "From a marketing perspective, the feature differentiation between 'Basic' and 'Standard' is not very clear. Customers might just default to the cheapest option. Can we make the value jump more obvious? For example, 'Standard' includes benchmarking against industry peers.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "lightbulb",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 89373,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "Industry benchmarking is a great idea, and it's something we can support with our BI tools, assuming we have the aggregated data. It's a strong value-add for the 'Standard' tier.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M42",
            "text": "Ok, I can add that. So 'Standard' gets benchmarking. What about the hours for Premium?",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 59192,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "I would add at least 5 more hours per quarter to the cost model for Premium to be safe.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 509812,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "We should also consider our pilot clients for T9. Are we offering them a special rate? A 'founder client' discount could be a good PR story and incentive for them to give detailed feedback.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T9"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 21210,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Love that idea. How about we offer the pilot clients the 'Standard' package at the 'Basic' price for the first 6 months? It's a clear, compelling offer.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "handshake",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M48",
            "speaker_id": 8267,
            "reply_to": "M47",
            "text": "Ok, a discount for pilot clients. I will add a note in the file.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M49",
            "speaker_id": 21210,
            "reply_to": "M48",
            "text": "Let's lock these decisions down so @8267 can finalize A3. \n1. We will proceed with the three tiers, but 'Standard' will now explicitly include industry benchmarking. 'Premium' cost model will be updated with 5 additional consultant hours. (D5)\n2. For the pilot, we will offer the 'Standard' package at the 'Basic' price for the first 6 months. (D6)\n\nEveryone aligned?",
            "mentions": [
