            "text": "Team, the pilot with our first three SME clients is complete. I've compiled the feedback and key metrics in the Pilot Feedback Log (A7). Overall, the response was positive, but there are definitely areas for improvement. Please take a look and share your thoughts on what we should prioritize for T12.",
